WEBVTT

00:05:27.912 --> 00:05:30.669
from one of the most beautiful
women on earth:

00:05:30.693 --> 00:05:33.388
no grunting, no coughing, no wheezing,

00:05:33.412 --> 00:05:35.885
no talking to yourselves, no farting.

00:05:35.909 --> 00:05:36.919
(Laughter)

00:05:36.943 --> 00:05:38.631
Well, she didn't say that, exactly.

00:05:38.655 --> 00:05:40.479
(Laughter)

00:05:40.503 --> 00:05:42.443
At some point around midnight,

00:05:42.467 --> 00:05:44.754
we were summoned
to the wings of the stadium,

00:05:44.778 --> 00:05:47.114
and the loudspeakers announced
the Olympic flag,

00:05:47.138 --> 00:05:48.660
and the music started --

00:05:48.684 --> 00:05:51.928
by the way, the same music
that starts here, the "Aida" march.

00:05:52.775 --> 00:05:55.639
Sophia Loren was right in front of me.

00:05:55.663 --> 00:05:59.373
She's a foot taller than I am,
not counting the poofy hair.

00:05:59.397 --> 00:06:00.416
(Laughter)